  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Benin Business Champions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to professionalise lead companies in the Beninese agri- &amp; foodsector, that want to start processing facilities or aim to improve or scale up their processing capacity. The business cases of these companies form building blocks for an individual and joint capacity building trajectory.The aim is to support the companies to have strong business operations, focussing on local value addition and creation of sustainable job opportunities.Based on the capacities, identified needs and challenges of these companies, the ecosystems in which they operate will be addressed and strengthened to tackle key challenges in the business environment.</narrative>
  </description>
